OL,3,GNEWSAPatients unable to view GP
OL,4,Apractice websites
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome GPs have asked patients to phone
OL,7,Fif they need to get in touch after a
OL,8,Fnumber of surgeries' websites crashed.
OL,10,FClicking on sites for the Norwich
OL,11,FHealth Centre and the Millwood Medical
OL,12,FPractice in Great Yarmouth, among
OL,13,Fothers, generated error messages.
OL,15,FGPs in England and Wales that use the
OL,16,Fcompany Silicon Practice, which
OL,17,Fprovides the services, were hit after
OL,18,Fit went into administration.
OL,20,FNHS England said less than 10% of its
OL,21,Fmore than 6,000 general practices had
OL,22,Fbeen affected.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
